 its faces are triangular.\n\n- The solid is not a heptagonal prism since it has only one heptagonal face.\n\n- The solid is not a hexagonal prism because it has no hexagonal face.\n\n- The solid is not a cube since it has triangular faces."} :step/id #uuid "0b209725-9e0d-563b-a187-f60cb609d0c8" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186414717}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186414715 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186414711 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12a030b9-4c33-563f-932d-cdf0103434a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/6a/6a0e4fa080407695749f4e204f08cc062828f358573d56b2bc7e8a25fb61c2c6.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414680} {:answer/id #uuid "40e3dace-c8f0-5451-8326-07ac6adb342d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/18/180c9fc2f5c00706683921067bd3d4ced0e9f514df89ac1de66d1c959efd81cc.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414689} {:answer/id #uuid "488d6f82-d92d-5984-aa98-caa3998bb08a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/9b/9b094303688730cbd49075ad75faa3705e00999d40f253addfda88365991e401.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414691} {:answer/id #uuid "b17cb05e-a4c9-58a6-946a-d88e0d16f2b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/50/50679b5a5b333daae4346bf729ac2791a1024baed9ae580918d37925c11fe7f1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414697} {:answer/id #uuid "be92cffe-3554-5972-9564-de1dcf9aba22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/9f/9feb81a7255725b4d1b370012db8b7f06981daea8c96f16aa5fc6a59ae0a8898.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414698}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186414691} :answer-field/id #uuid "8e137d3c-1309-5a42-8f77-b44643406daf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186414706}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "60a685f7-2a5b-5185-bd48-1abde4b2de57" :question/math-academy-id "q-69873" 